{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚解释了安慰如何转成想延续亲近的需要，又如何因对方心意未定而受阻，最终形成舒服却无法彻底安定的感受；但从已经满足到想要延续的转折略显跳跃，对身体先于念头的反应、急切为何恰在此刻冒出，以及暂时沉浸如何反过来改变情绪，都缺少具体机制。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版较清楚地解释了身体防备松动如何先带来漂浮的自在、安稳为何没有消除未满足的需要，以及热烈退下后为何转为想确认心意却只能等待，并把时间流逝与流动受阻联系起来；但对方心意未明、时间不可留住等具体原因仍属于较强的心理诠释，部分推演有所重复，H编号本身也不能代替解释。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的实质优势不是篇幅，而是更完整地说明了身体先松动、安稳暂时缓解悬空感却未解决需要、继而产生确认冲动又因缺少答案而沉回等待的因果链，虽然部分心理动机比听感记录本身更具体，但没有因此破坏其对段内转折的解释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "932eb61b-9d77-4d58-9a14-540074681cf5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133518570251Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:36:14.760542+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "11a31e4531020846d0660ed178df704286f7b9cc644733d37ec4c3691d194f99", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31